{"4177790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alastrius: Star-Fighter", "steam_appid": 4177790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/2dacff0860a95cc57c8e72a041cca00c.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span>Launch your heavily armed Star-Fighter into devastating battles across the galaxy in an intense on-the-rails space shooter. Take the role of a skilled fighter pilot assigned to the Interstellar Battleship <i><strong>Alastrius</strong></i>, the only capital ship still fighting for the Republic following a sudden coup d'état. Your mission is simple; blast a path through numerous enemy strongholds, liberate the capital world <i><strong>Velora</strong></i> and restore the Republic. However the enemy forces are vast and they will throw every weapon they have in your path.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/b39943aad7eae268b6bd63140fc69513.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/b39943aad7eae268b6bd63140fc69513.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/b39943aad7eae268b6bd63140fc69513.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/9e4894dff8f99037a7a789aa1c346eea.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lush green forests to vast deserts, explore bottomless icy glaciers and broken volcanic mining worlds. Plot a course through 16 different planets, space stations, nebulae and other hazardous locations as you guide the Battleship <i><strong>Alastrius</strong></i> back to its home world. With numerous different missions and storyline developments  it will take many playthroughs to discover everything.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/4eab53500071fd30c15174d8a4fbe575.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/4eab53500071fd30c15174d8a4fbe575.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/4eab53500071fd30c15174d8a4fbe575.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/a41a2ab77b607883c4791ee4115a482e.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span>  The Battleship <strong><i>Alastrius</i></strong> carries a diverse range of playable Star-Fighters from nimble, lightly armed ships to hulking goliaths. When a Star-Fighter is lost in combat its gone for the rest of the campaign so choose your fighters for each mission wisely. The game begins with three different Star-Fighters with a further seven that can be unlocked.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/325bccd05ddc92baaa0a090e116d9bab.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/325bccd05ddc92baaa0a090e116d9bab.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/325bccd05ddc92baaa0a090e116d9bab.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/7fcf062950b5c05024b5581b3172ca30.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Star-Fighter is equipped with multiple Laser Cannons able to shred through enemies, even at long range. If more firepower is needed powerful homing Missiles can make short work of even the toughest targets and if that's not enough the Star-Fighters arsenal of Bombs can devastate everything in a vast area. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/4b85dd5989302cfa13887ec7661d3f83.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/4b85dd5989302cfa13887ec7661d3f83.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/4b85dd5989302cfa13887ec7661d3f83.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/ac5219f4185bd9aaa3212ea175d4eb7a.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The devious Imperium have usurped almost the entire Republic military and will throw hordes of forces at you including drones, fighters, tanks, boats, turrets, mines and traps. Find your enemies weakpoints to destroy them efficiently and rack up impression mission high scores. Can you earn a Gold Medal in every Mission?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/0dd76465484d754035d2c88164b10cc2.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/559a34c60a53def044dc39b2a622f18c.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span>Saving the most insane superweapons to the end of every mission these hulking war machines will test your skills. Depending on your path a different boss may be poised to strike.  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/6b34a8e8241d6604d61a310fca87828c.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/6b34a8e8241d6604d61a310fca87828c.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/6b34a8e8241d6604d61a310fca87828c.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/b5670ec4cd801bcafd9b56bb283e294d.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiarise yourself with the Star-Fighters controls and weapons systems by taking on the Training Simulator. You have been assigned a Dispatch Officer onboard the battleship <i><strong>Alastrius</strong></i>; <i><strong>Rahalla</strong></i> who is fully voice acted will be your loyal companion guiding your Star-Fighter through the Training Simulator. <i><strong>Rahalla</strong></i> will also guide you through all the campaign missions, sharing developments as the civil war unfolds.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/2904d956b8013a0281290e89d2014c19.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/2904d956b8013a0281290e89d2014c19.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/2904d956b8013a0281290e89d2014c19.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/98cd83ed901aebaf704bdfb47a8d95df.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains 40 Steam Achievements if you are looking for a wide array of additional challenges. Achievements are also tracked independently within each of the games six Save Files so friends or family with access to your Steam Account can still go Achievement hunting themselves even if you have unlocked them already on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/5adcafd1241a931e714486aa9de3760f.avif?t=1787245909\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras_big/5adcafd1241a931e714486aa9de3760f.avif?t=1787245909 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/14b4ae6c6f83c9fd9688c77174075fa1.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span>  Alastrius offers full Keyboard-and-Mouse controls allowing you to shoot using the Mouse with pinpoint accuracy.  If you prefer the Gamepad get ready for a classic Twin-Stick Shooter experience.  Both control systems offer full rebinding options.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/f3aa560bc5ae8a3f8d8582ca15d239f7.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/ed8b383263618fb56337085a35672587.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alastrius features heavily stylized envrionments and vehicles with sharp lines and bold colours.  The game is packed with atmospheric music and intense retro boss tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/c1ed1a318937655030e29551faf5393f.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/c1ed1a318937655030e29551faf5393f.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/c1ed1a318937655030e29551faf5393f.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/2dacff0860a95cc57c8e72a041cca00c.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span>Launch your heavily armed Star-Fighter into devastating battles across the galaxy in an intense on-the-rails space shooter. Take the role of a skilled fighter pilot assigned to the Interstellar Battleship <i><strong>Alastrius</strong></i>, the only capital ship still fighting for the Republic following a sudden coup d'état. Your mission is simple; blast a path through numerous enemy strongholds, liberate the capital world <i><strong>Velora</strong></i> and restore the Republic. However the enemy forces are vast and they will throw every weapon they have in your path.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/b39943aad7eae268b6bd63140fc69513.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/b39943aad7eae268b6bd63140fc69513.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/b39943aad7eae268b6bd63140fc69513.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/9e4894dff8f99037a7a789aa1c346eea.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lush green forests to vast deserts, explore bottomles