f forces at you including drones, fighters, tanks, boats, turrets, mines and traps. Find your enemies weakpoints to destroy them efficiently and rack up impression mission high scores. Can you earn a Gold Medal in every Mission?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/0dd76465484d754035d2c88164b10cc2.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/559a34c60a53def044dc39b2a622f18c.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span>Saving the most insane superweapons to the end of every mission these hulking war machines will test your skills. Depending on your path a different boss may be poised to strike.  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/6b34a8e8241d6604d61a310fca87828c.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/6b34a8e8241d6604d61a310fca87828c.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/6b34a8e8241d6604d61a310fca87828c.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/b5670ec4cd801bcafd9b56bb283e294d.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiarise yourself with the Star-Fighters controls and weapons systems by taking on the Training Simulator. You have been assigned a Dispatch Officer onboard the battleship <i><strong>Alastrius</strong></i>; <i><strong>Rahalla</strong></i> who is fully voice acted will be your loyal companion guiding your Star-Fighter through the Training Simulator. <i><strong>Rahalla</strong></i> will also guide you through all the campaign missions, sharing developments as the civil war unfolds.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/2904d956b8013a0281290e89d2014c19.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/2904d956b8013a0281290e89d2014c19.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/2904d956b8013a0281290e89d2014c19.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/98cd83ed901aebaf704bdfb47a8d95df.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains 40 Steam Achievements if you are looking for a wide array of additional challenges. Achievements are also tracked independently within each of the games six Save Files so friends or family with access to your Steam Account can still go Achievement hunting themselves even if you have unlocked them already on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/5adcafd1241a931e714486aa9de3760f.avif?t=1787245909\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras_big/5adcafd1241a931e714486aa9de3760f.avif?t=1787245909 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/14b4ae6c6f83c9fd9688c77174075fa1.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span>  Alastrius offers full Keyboard-and-Mouse controls allowing you to shoot using the Mouse with pinpoint accuracy.  If you prefer the Gamepad get ready for a classic Twin-Stick Shooter experience.  Both control systems offer full rebinding options.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/f3aa560bc5ae8a3f8d8582ca15d239f7.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/ed8b383263618fb56337085a35672587.avif?t=1787245909\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alastrius features heavily stylized envrionments and vehicles with sharp lines and bold colours.  The game is packed with atmospheric music and intense retro boss tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/c1ed1a318937655030e29551faf5393f.poster.avif?t=1787245909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/c1ed1a318937655030e29551faf5393f.webm?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/extras/c1ed1a318937655030e29551faf5393f.mp4?t=1787245909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "In this explosive on-the-rails shooter pilot powerful Star-Fighters and wage a vast interstellar war. Chart your own course across a galaxy of exotic sci-fi worlds as you carve a path to the Capital. Lay waste to hordes of enemy ships and bring down ruthless bosses. You are the Republics last hope!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/1b98b8374252d604628e6adb5845a7c19753a170/header.jpg?t=1787245909", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/b9ab947ab44b1f569af213acbe6fc9b260cd8595/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787245909", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177790/b9ab947ab44b1f569af213acbe6fc9b260cd8595/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787245909", "website": "https://www.alastrius.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows compatible Sound Card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 4060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows compatible Sound Card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2026 Caledonia Interactive Limited. Alastrius™ and a